## Install the skills

```bash
uvx {{DIST}} install
```

That copies every bundled skill into each agent harness it finds on this
machine. Pick explicitly with `--target` (repeatable):

| `--target` | User-level directory | Project-level (`--project`) |
|---|---|---|
| `agents` | `~/.agents/skills/` | `.agents/skills/` |
| `claude` | `~/.claude/skills/` | `.claude/skills/` |
| `hermes` | `~/.hermes/skills/` | `.hermes/skills/` |
| `opencode` | `~/.config/opencode/skills/` | `.opencode/skills/` |
| `pi` | `~/.pi/agent/skills/` | none |

`--target codex` is an alias for `agents`.

```bash
uvx {{DIST}} install --target claude   # one harness
uvx {{DIST}} install --dir ./skills    # any directory
uvx {{DIST}} install --dry-run         # preview
uvx {{DIST}} install --force           # overwrite existing copies
uvx {{DIST}} uninstall                 # remove them again
uvx {{DIST}} list                      # list the bundled skills
```

